n a school card.'=>__('Scan a school card.'),'This browser cannot scan a camera code. Use a supported school device or enter the secure app code.'=>__('This browser cannot scan a camera code. Use a supported school device or enter the secure app code.'),'Camera access is unavailable. Enter the secure app code or use a supported school device.'=>__('Camera access is unavailable. Enter the secure app code or use a supported school device.'),'Secure tap is unavailable in this browser. Use a supported school reader.'=>__('Secure tap is unavailable in this browser. Use a supported school reader.'),'Tap the personalized secure card.'=>__('Tap the personalized secure card.'),'Secure tap could not start. Use the app code or a supported school reader.'=>__('Secure tap could not start. Use the app code or a supported school reader.'),'Connection interrupted. Retry the same verification.'=>__('Connection interrupted. Retry the same verification.'),'Early collection could not be checked. Reconnect and scan again.'=>__('Early collection could not be checked. Reconnect and scan again.'),'No current staff-approved collection pass.'=>__('No current staff-approved collection pass.'),'Named collector'=>__('Named collector'),'I checked the named collector in person.'=>__('I checked the named collector in person.'),'Record collection'=>__('Record collection'),'Collection recorded.'=>__('Collection recorded.'),'Collection outcome is uncertain. Retry the same record before another scan.'=>__('Collection outcome is uncertain. Retry the same record before another scan.'),'Collection was refused. Scan again and check current approval.'=>__('Collection was refused. Scan again and check current approval.'),'Retry or clear the previous collection before scanning another card.'=>__('Retry or clear the previous collection before scanning another card.')], JSON_UNESCAPED_UNICODE) }}">
